                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Sadly I got this in a bundle pack, which had another game in it. Bundle for $20 USD and this was $15 USD. so really not off to a great start. It handles much like a RTS so cant really complain there however with the battles seem to short. Idk also the game feels janky. when compared to another game like \"Total War\" where you can move more guys this game lacks flow and yeah you could argue its a 10 year old game but this is just bad for $15 and to just conversion of a board game i hope the reason its $15 USD is for the licensing. I guess the real issue is that you can re-create something and have a \"legacy mode\" or something but to bring nothing new is just wrong.",
